## schema.json.evid
error[schema] schema.json.evid:7 (/source/interval): invalid duration `soon`: use e.g. `30m`, `6h`, `1d`, `2weeks`, `1h 30m`
## semantic.md.evid
error[id] semantic.md.evid:3 (/id): invalid id `Bad Id`: use lowercase letters, digits, `.`, `_`, `-`
error[claim] semantic.md.evid:5 (/claims/0): claim `c` needs `evidence` or `origin = "primary"`
error[duplicate] semantic.md.evid:9 (/claims/1): claim id `c` is used twice
error[claim] semantic.md.evid:9 (/claims/1): claim `c` has both `evidence` and `origin`; choose one
## syntax.json.evid
error[toml] syntax.json.evid:2: string values must be quoted, expected literal string
## command.json.evid
error[action-field] command.json.evid:7 (/transform/interval): `interval` is only allowed in `[source]`, not `[transform]`
error[run] command.json.evid:8 (/transform/locator/commit): locator `commit` needs a program
error[placeholder] command.json.evid:6 (/transform/run/3): `{input.sbom}` does not name an input of `c`
error[placeholder] command.json.evid:6 (/transform/run/4): unknown placeholder `{outptu}` (known: output, subject, root, dir, id, cache, context, input.NAME, input.NAME.snapshot, env.NAME)
error[placeholder] command.json.evid:8 (/transform/locator/token): `{env.NAME}` is not allowed in a locator value: the locator is written to the evidence file, and environment variables may hold secrets
error[action-field] command.json.evid:11 (/verify/stdout): `stdout` is not allowed in `[verify]`: a check reads `{output}`
## kind.json.evid
error[kind-field] kind.json.evid: kind `derived` requires a `[transform]` table
error[kind-field] kind.json.evid: kind `derived` requires at least one input
error[kind-field] kind.json.evid:4 (/source): `source` is not allowed for kind `derived`
